{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1534919-using-wp-when-raging-back-from-death","id":1534919,"title":"Using WP when raging back from death","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-29T14:54:25-07:00","id":1534919,"title":"Using WP when raging back from death","content":"Can garou spend a point of WP to guarantee one success when raging back from damage that would otherwise kill them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26645-pwtucker","name":"pwtucker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26645_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T14:56:12-07:00","id":1534920,"title":"","content":"It doesn't say that you can't, so you can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T15:28:05-07:00","id":1534921,"title":"","content":"RAW does allow some ST say so on purely reflexive rolls that your character isn't consciously performing.<br /> <br /> But since you can only do it once a scene anyway, spending WP on it isn't breaking the game. Especially since the number of successes matters a lot. Just passing with one success has a high chance of death on the next round if you can't get a major healing first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T23:40:34-07:00","id":1534930,"title":"","content":"Well, returning with one health and no wound penalty in fox frenzy might safe your life but harm your renown. But, as you say, if you stay in berserker frenzy, one health is not much to go on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-01T08:06:04-07:00","id":1535010,"title":"","content":"Even fox frenzy isn't a guaranteed escaped. If your enemy's have any ranged attacks, or just go before you start running, you'll be in trouble of taking that final hit.<br /> <br /> It's a nice perk in the game, and it's definitely kept a lot of PCs alive in my long time playing WtA, but more as safe gap in the rules rather than pure ST fiat to keep PCs from dying from an unlucky set of rolls in a violence heavy game. If the ST wants your PC(s) dead, or the players insist on going down a path no matter how much the ST warns them they're headed into &quot;death is probably going to happen if you don't try something else&quot; territory, it's not going to save them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-01T10:20:32-07:00","id":1535027,"title":"","content":"Even if it was a more pronounced advantage for escape, it would hardly be unbalanced to let them use WP.<br /> <br /> Survival is rarely the main goal of the characters. If they're trying to escape they probably already suffered a heavy and/or shameful loss.<br /> <br /> Killing them on top of that is usually more trouble than it is really worth it. Giving them this little extra advantage will be a time and frustration saver more than not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}